+title: "Integrating experimental data and mechanistic modeling to assess potential lead exposure from tampon use"
+authors: ["Corie A. Ellison", "Patrick R. Doyle", "Christina A. Haven", "Denise M. McClenathan", "Cindy M. Obringer", "Kara E. Woeller"]
+year: 2026
+publication: "Toxicological Sciences"
+doi: "10.1093/toxsci/kfag052"
+source_type: peer-reviewed
+evidence_tier: A
